stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> created: 创建评分会话
  created --> prepared: 上传视频/绑定录制/准备证据
  prepared --> processing: start
  processing --> extracting: 提取音频/视频帧/转写
  extracting --> scoring: 规则评分/LLM评分
  scoring --> reporting: 生成结构化报告
  reporting --> completed: 回调成功
  processing --> failed: 处理失败
  extracting --> failed
  scoring --> failed
  reporting --> failed
  failed --> processing: restart
  processing --> cancelled: cancel
  completed --> jury_review: 发起评审团
